  timeout (`keepAliveTimeout` 65 s, `headersTimeout` above it), or a request
  racing a close gets a 502. [test]
- On `SIGTERM` (an instance being replaced or scaled in) stop accepting
  connections, finish the requests in flight, then let the process end.
  Never `process.exit()`. [lint: no-restricted-properties]
- Await every promise, or void it on purpose with a comment: a rejected
  promise nobody awaits ends the process.
  [lint: @typescript-eslint/no-floating-promises]
- Don't keep request data in module-scope variables: the next request on the
  same instance would see it, and other instances would not. [review]

