- The newest Node.js runtime. [nag: AwsSolutions-L1]
{{- end }}
- `arm64` (Graviton): cheaper per millisecond and lower energy. [review]
- Memory and timeout set for the work, the timeout {{ if $queue }}at most a sixth of the queue's
  visibility timeout{{ else }}under API Gateway's 30
